      transportdirection  upstream    
      2                               
      0                               
       egressqueueforpushed folly  none 1024                      
      1024                      
      http2  defaultpriority    
      1                         
     
 
    
  expect txnwithegresscomplete- isegresscomplete filterwithcompletetxn   std  make unique mockwebtransportfilter   
      txnwithegresscomplete codecversion  h3   
  filterwithcompletetxn- sethandler handler expect call  txnwithegresscomplete  sendeom    times 0   
 
    
    
  expect call  filterwithcompletetxn  onclosesession     
       willonce invoke closewebtransportsessioncapsule  capsule    
        filterwithcompletetxn- webtransportfilter  onclosesession capsule   
           
 
  expect call  handler   onsessionend optional uint32 t  wt code capsuledata   createclosesessioncapsule    
  filterwithcompletetxn- onbody std  move capsuledata    
  
 
